    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pugnātor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		pugno, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a fighter</i>, <i>combatant</i> (perh. not
			ante-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Liv. 24, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Caes. 39 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 15,
				598</span></i>.—Appos.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Dominus quasi vir pugnator,</span>”
