					Exod. 15, 3</span></i>
			; id. Josue, 17, 1.—<b>Transf.</b>,
				adj.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gallus,</span>”
				<i>a fighting-cock</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 15, 49, § 142</span></i>
			.</div>
